cktops when splay-arraying multiples.  \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDimensions are 22.5\" x 14.75\" x 12\".\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis horn has a 2\" diameter throat.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-05-25T11:14:15-05:00","created_at":"2024-05-25T11:14:15-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00","vendor":"HOQS","product_type":"Horn","tags":["2\" throat horn","60x40 coverage","60x40 horn","HF horn","horn","splay array horn"],"variants":[{"id":41355722784854,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"170.00","grams":5443,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7244767264854,"created_at":"2024-05-25T11:14:15-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":34200067571798,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:58:55-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:38-05:00","product_id":7244767264854,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/Back_Iso.png?v=1756579238","width":3840,"height":2880},{"id":34200067735638,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:59:02-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:38-05:00","product_id":7244767264854,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/Front.png?v=1756579238","width":3840,"height":2880},{"id":34200067702870,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:59:02-05:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:38-05:00","product_id":7244767264854,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/Rear_Top.png?v=1756579238","width":3840,"height":2880},{"id":34200067670102,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:59:02-05:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:38-05:00","product_id":7244767264854,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/Side.png?v=1756579238","width":3840,"height":2880}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":7244766543958,"title":"HOQS N216C 21\" Neodymium LF","handle":"hoqs-f216c-neo-21","body_html":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003eThis driver's motor is designed with Finite Element Analysis modeling (FEA) and outfitted with a high grade temperature stable Neodymium magnet structure to produce an abundance of motor force.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003eThis driver has been designed to meet the needs of HOQS Paraflex enclosures. \u003cbr\u003eParaflex enclosures are essentially Compound QW\/Horn designs which place quarterwave resonators (whether flared\/hornlike or not) both in front of and behind the driver(s), thereby fully utilizing the driver's front \u0026amp; rear wave. This alignment puts significant backpressure or loading on the driver's cone (not unlike what we can expect from other extremely efficient enclosures) which can cause distortion or even physical failure if the cone is not strong enough for the task. Therefore, as is classically known a driver well suited to this level of Horn Loading or Compound QW\/Horn Loading must not only have a strong cone but also calls for a motor which is designed to remain cool enough when cone movement is well controlled (or even strictly controlled) during operation.  Our F185C's motor features high grade ferrite material in the amounts required to produce force comparable to our neodymium option at less cost, and this motor force commands the load with precision \u0026amp; authority while the carbon fiber cone acts as our rigid resilient diaphragm for the purpose of minimum distortion and maximum output with high reliability. Last but not least this driver's suspension is designed to be sufficiently compliant for the purpose of reducing restriction to movement which is beneficial in a scenario where the driver's cone is already heavily loaded due to the very high efficiency enclosure design.  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-05-25T11:12:21-05:00","created_at":"2024-05-25T11:12:21-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00","vendor":"HOQS","product_type":"Speaker","tags":["21\" subwoofer driver","6 inch voicecoil","6\" voicecoil","Carbon Fiber cone","neo subwoofer driver","neodymium","raw 21\" driver","Subwoofer"],"variants":[{"id":41355720720470,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"775.00","grams":24000,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7244766543958,"created_at":"2024-05-25T11:12:22-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":32682558095446,"created_at":"2024-05-25T11:12:38-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:41-05:00","product_id":7244766543958,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/Neo21.png?v=1756579241","width":723,"height":637},{"id":33328095789142,"created_at":"2024-09-10T12:59:38-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:41-05:00","product_id":7244766543958,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/418276250_751823920247304_8218955578837351259_n.jpg?v=1756579241","width":1500,"height":2000},{"id":33328095821910,"created_at":"2024-09-10T12:59:38-05:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:41-05:00","product_id":7244766543958,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/431240463_8073398179344031_8007099134138971584_n.jpg?v=1756579241","width":1440,"height":1440},{"id":33328095854678,"created_at":"2024-09-10T12:59:38-05:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:41-05:00","product_id":7244766543958,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/HOQS_N216C_Patrick_Kascak.jpg?v=1756579241","width":1080,"height":1350},{"id":33328095887446,"created_at":"2024-09-10T12:59:38-05:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:40:41-05:00","product_id":7244766543958,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/N216C_rear_view.jpg?v=1756579241","width":1108,"height":1030}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":7063501930582,"title":"HOQS N185C 18\" Neodymium LF","handle":"n185c-18-neodymium-carbon-fiber-subwoofer","body_html":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003eThis driver's motor is designed with Finite Element Analysis modeling (FEA) and outfitted with high grade neodymium yet temperature stable material to produce an abundance of motor force.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003eOptimized for HOQS Paraflex cabinet designs but will also work in other Folded Horn subwoofers designs, Scoops, RLH\/BLH, QWP, FLH, Tapped Horn, Bandpass or Reflex cabinets.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-04-01T21:14:48-05:00","created_at":"2024-04-01T21:14:48-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00","vendor":"HOQS","product_type":"Speaker","tags":["18\"","Subwoofer"],"variants":[{"id":40914174672982,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"635.00","grams":17237,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":7063501930582,"created_at":"2024-04-01T21:14:49-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":34200076812374,"created_at":"2025-03-25T21:05:44-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-25T21:05:54-05:00","product_id":7063501930582,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/HOQS_N185C_V2_2024-Aug-21_10-08-32AM-000_CustomizedView37144502662_d0755491-77ed-451a-8032-e440011246fd.png?v=1742954754","width":1920,"height":1440},{"id":34200076779606,"created_at":"2025-03-25T21:05:44-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-03-25T21:05:54-05:00","product_id":7063501930582,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/HOQS_N185C_V2_2024-Aug-08_01-52-09PM-000_CustomizedView10270305847_7117806e-7fee-4b6a-85aa-4a927ac717fc.png?v=1742954754","width":1409,"height":1057}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":6822415401046,"title":"HOQS F185C Ferrite 18\" LF","handle":"hoqs-carbon-fiber-18","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003eThis driver's motor is designed with Finite Element Analysis modeling (FEA) and outfitted with high grade Y35 ferrite material at 30mm thickness and 280mm diameter to produce an abundance of motor force.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis driver has been designed to meet the needs of HOQS Paraflex enclosures. \u003cbr\u003eParaflex enclosures are essentially Compound QW\/Horn designs which place quarterwave resonators (whether flared\/hornlike or not) both in front of and behind the driver(s), thereby fully utilizing the driver's front \u0026amp; rear wave. This alignment puts significant backpressure or loading on the driver's cone (not unlike what we can expect from other extremely efficient enclosures) which can cause distortion or even physical failure if the cone is not strong enough for the task. Therefore, as is classically known a driver well suited to this level of Horn Loading or Compound QW\/Horn Loading must not only have a strong cone but also calls for a motor which is designed to remain cool enough when cone movement is well controlled (or even strictly controlled) during operation.  Our F185C's motor features high grade ferrite material in the amounts required to produce force comparable to our neodymium option at less cost, and this motor force commands the load with precision \u0026amp; authority while the carbon fiber cone acts as our rigid resilient diaphragm for the purpose of minimum distortion and maximum output with high reliability. Last but not least this driver's suspension is designed to be sufficiently compliant for the purpose of reducing restriction to movement which is beneficial in a scenario where the driver's cone is already heavily loaded due to the very high efficiency enclosure design. \u003cspan class=\"C9DxTc\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2022-10-11T00:00:36-05:00","created_at":"2022-10-11T00:00:35-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00","vendor":"HOQS","product_type":"Speaker","tags":["18 inch driver","18\" PA subwoofer driver","18\" Raw driver","Subwoofer","Subwoofer driver"],"variants":[{"id":40099944792150,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"450.00","grams":24748,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":6822415401046,"created_at":"2022-10-11T00:00:35-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:32:51-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":34200064852054,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:57:56-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-25T20:58:07-05:00","product_id":6822415401046,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/HOQS_F185C_V1_4K_Side_200mm.png?v=1742954287","width":3840,"height":2880},{"id":34200064557142,"created_at":"2025-03-25T20:57:43-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-03-25T20:58:07-05:00","product_id":6822415401046,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0553\/2028\/1174\/files\/HOQS_F185C_V1_4K_ISO_90mm.png?v=1742954287","width":3840,"height":2880}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]}]}